      "title": "Python: remove fail-open renderer fallbacks",
      "steps": [
        "Update pydantic renderer to stop silently returning Any for unknown IR kinds",
        "Update unresolved ref rendering path to fail with explicit conversion error",
        "Add unit tests for unknown kind and unresolved ref behavior",
        "Keep successful render paths unchanged"
