    },
    {
      "id": "8",
      "title": "Python: preserve type information in mixed allOf",
      "steps": [
        "Refactor mixed allOf rendering to emit the narrowest representable type instead of Annotated[Any, BeforeValidator(...)] when possible",
        "Keep runtime validator sequencing and error behavior intact",
        "Add fixture coverage for TSConfig-like mixed allOf schemas",
        "Ensure generated lookup type for that fixture is no longer TypeAdapter[Any]"
