      "title": "Python: narrow oneOf/not/conditional/typeGuarded typing",
      "steps": [
        "Introduce helper logic to compute a safe narrow static type expression for semantic combinators",
        "Replace Annotated[Any, BeforeValidator(...)] with Annotated[<narrower-type>, BeforeValidator(...)] where representable",
        "Use a shared broad-safe fallback only when no stronger static form exists",
        "Add focused tests for oneOf, not, conditional, and typeGuarded fixtures"
